---
import PrimaryLayout from "../../layouts/PrimaryLayout.astro"
---

<>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL@20..48,100..700,0..1" />
</>

<PrimaryLayout>
    <main>
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden">
            <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 py-10">
                <div class="@container">
                    <div class="flex min-h-[520px] flex-col gap-6 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat rounded-xl items-center justify-center p-8 text-center" style='background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 100%), url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559027615-cd2628902d4a?w=1200&h=520&fit=crop")'>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-2xl">
                            <h1 class="text-white text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight @[480px]:text-6xl">
                                Membangun Masa Depan Bersama
                            </h1>
                            <p class="text-white/90 text-base @[480px]:text-xl font-normal leading-relaxed">
                                HarumCare berkomitmen untuk memberikan solusi digital terbaik dalam membantu Anda mengelola zakat dan amal dengan mudah dan transparan.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex gap-4 mt-4">
                            <button class="bg-primary text-[#111815] px-8 py-3 rounded-lg text-base font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
                                Pelajari Lebih Lanjut
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Our Story Section -->
        <section class="max-w-300 mx-auto px-6 py-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-primary text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Sejarah Kami</h2>
                <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">Perjalanan Kami dalam Pelayanan Digital</h3>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    HarumCare dimulai dari sebuah visi sederhana: membuat proses mengeluarkan zakat menjadi lebih mudah dan transparan bagi semua umat Muslim di Indonesia.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Kami percaya bahwa teknologi digital dapat memberdayakan masyarakat untuk melaksanakan kewajiban mereka dengan lebih efisien. Sejak awal, kami berkomitmen pada transparansi, akurasi, dan kemudahan dalam setiap aspek layanan kami.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500">
                <img alt="HarumCare Team" class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=500&h=400&fit=crop" />
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Vision & Mission Section -->
        <section class="bg-white dark:bg-[#152a21] py-20 border-y border-[#dbe6e1] dark:border-[#2a3a34]">
            <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6">
                <div class="text-center mb-16">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Visi & Misi Kami</h2>
                    <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-primary mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#dbe6e1] dark:border-[#2a3a34] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <div class="bg-primary/20 w-14 h-14 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">visibility</span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-tight">Visi</h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-normal">
                            Menjadi platform digital terdepan yang memberdayakan umat Muslim untuk menjalankan kewajiban zakat dengan mudah, akurat, dan transparan.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#dbe6e1] dark:border-[#2a3a34] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark p-8 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <div class="bg-primary/20 w-14 h-14 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">track_changes</span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-tight">Misi</h2>
                        <ul class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-2">
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-1 material-symbols-outlined text-sm">check_circle</span> Menyediakan kalkulator zakat yang akurat dan mudah digunakan.</li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-1 material-symbols-outlined text-sm">check_circle</span> Memfasilitasi pembayaran zakat dengan sistem keamanan terjamin.</li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-1 material-symbols-outlined text-sm">check_circle</span> Menjamin transparansi penuh dalam penyaluran dana zakat.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Impact Timeline -->
        <section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 py-20">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Perjalanan Kami</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Milestone penting dalam pengembangan HarumCare</p>
            </div>
            <div class="relative border-l-2 border-primary/30 ml-4 md:ml-0 md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2">
                <!-- Timeline Item 1 -->
                <div class="mb-12 relative">
                    <div class="absolute -left-[11px] md:left-1/2 md:-ml-[11px] w-5 h-5 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-white dark:border-background-dark"></div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-12 md:text-right pl-8 md:pl-0">
                        <span class="text-primary font-bold text-xl">2024</span>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1">Peluncuran Platform</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">HarumCare diluncurkan sebagai platform digital pertama untuk menghitung zakat dengan mudah.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Timeline Item 2 -->
                <div class="mb-12 relative">
                    <div class="absolute -left-[11px] md:left-1/2 md:-ml-[11px] w-5 h-5 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-white dark:border-background-dark"></div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:ml-auto md:pl-12 pl-8">
                        <span class="text-primary font-bold text-xl">2024</span>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1">Integrasi Pembayaran</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Menambahkan fitur pembayaran zakat terintegrasi dengan berbagai metode pembayaran.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Timeline Item 3 -->
                <div class="mb-12 relative">
                    <div class="absolute -left-[11px] md:left-1/2 md:-ml-[11px] w-5 h-5 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-white dark:border-background-dark"></div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-12 md:text-right pl-8 md:pl-0">
                        <span class="text-primary font-bold text-xl">2025</span>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1">Fitur Edukasi</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Meluncurkan blog dan konten edukasi tentang zakat dan amal untuk komunitas kami.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Timeline Item 4 -->
                <div class="relative">
                    <div class="absolute -left-[11px] md:left-1/2 md:-ml-[11px] w-5 h-5 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-white dark:border-background-dark"></div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 md:ml-auto md:pl-12 pl-8">
                        <span class="text-primary font-bold text-xl">2025</span>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mt-1">Ekspansi Fitur</h4>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Menambahkan fitur pelacakan donasi dan laporan transparansi untuk membangun kepercayaan.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Team Section -->
        <section class="bg-white dark:bg-[#152a21] py-20">
            <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 text-center">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12">Tim Kami</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
                    <div class="group">
                        <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 relative bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-6xl text-gray-500">account_circle</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg">Nama Founder</h4>
                        <p class="text-primary text-sm font-medium">Founder & CEO</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="group">
                        <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 relative bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-6xl text-gray-500">account_circle</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg">Nama Tim</h4>
                        <p class="text-primary text-sm font-medium">Product Lead</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="group">
                        <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 relative bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-6xl text-gray-500">account_circle</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg">Nama Tim</h4>
                        <p class="text-primary text-sm font-medium">Lead Developer</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="group">
                        <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 relative bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-6xl text-gray-500">account_circle</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg">Nama Tim</h4>
                        <p class="text-primary text-sm font-medium">Community Manager</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Values Section -->
        <section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 py-20 border-t border-[#dbe6e1] dark:border-[#2a3a34]">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Nilai-Nilai Kami</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Prinsip yang memandu setiap keputusan kami</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-[#dbe6e1] dark:border-[#2a3a34] rounded-lg flex flex-col items-start hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-4">verified_user</span>
                    <h5 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Transparansi</h5>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Kami berkomitmen memberikan laporan lengkap tentang setiap transaksi dan penggunaan dana.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-[#dbe6e1] dark:border-[#2a3a34] rounded-lg flex flex-col items-start hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-4">security</span>
                    <h5 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Keamanan</h5>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Data dan transaksi Anda dilindungi dengan enkripsi tingkat enterprise dan standar keamanan internasional.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-[#dbe6e1] dark:border-[#2a3a34] rounded-lg flex flex-col items-start hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-4">favorite</span>
                    <h5 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Kepedulian</h5>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Kami peduli dengan dampak sosial dan terus berinovasi untuk meningkatkan layanan kami.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA Section -->
        <section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 pb-20">
            <div class="bg-primary rounded-2xl p-10 md:p-16 text-[#111815] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
                <div class="max-w-xl">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Siap Memulai?</h2>
                    <p class="text-lg font-medium opacity-80">Bergabunglah dengan ribuan pengguna yang telah merasakan kemudahan dalam menghitung dan membayar zakat.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full md:w-auto">
                    <button class="bg-[#111815] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-[#111815]/90 transition-all whitespace-nowrap">Mulai Sekarang</button>
                    <button class="bg-white text-[#111815] border-2 border-transparent px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-transparent hover:border-[#111815] transition-all whitespace-nowrap">Pelajari Lebih Lanjut</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</PrimaryLayout>